        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana OK6038B, 6\" x 3-7/8\" Olive Knuckle Hinge</b>\r\n<p>The Deltana Olive Knuckle Hinge is a Paumelle hinge where the knuckles have an olive shape. It is best suited for light-weight doors such as kitchen cabinet doors or bathroom vanity doors. This solid brass hinge measures 6 inches high and 3-7/8 inches wide. Founded in 1977, Deltana is the architectural hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality.\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana OK6038B Light Weight Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Wing Width: 7/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Overall Width: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Thickness: 7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n<Li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screw: #12x1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK6038B-specifications.pdf?v=1704262253\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana OK6038B Hinge Specification (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-6038B-specifications.jpg?v=1704442272\" width=\"400\" height=\"446\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana OK6038B Specifications\"></p>\r\n<p>No matter which of the beautiful 11 finishes you choose, the parts will still be made of high quality solid brass. The Deltana Crown Life Time Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Sold Individually</b></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "6 Inch x 3-7/8 Inch Olive Knuckle Hinge, Deltana OK6038B",
                "description": "Deltana OK6038B 6 x 3-7/8 inch Olive Knuckle Hinge - The 6 inch solid brass Olive Knuckle Hinge is a full mortise, extruded hinge. It is made by Deltana, a leader in quality architectural hardware. Available in 11 finishes, this cabinet door hinge uses a #12x1-1/4 inch wood screw.",
                "keywords": "Deltana OK6038B olive knuckle hinges, deltana solid brass cabinet hinges, del-OK6038B, deltana OK6038, 6 inch cabinet door hinges, deltana architectural hardware hinges, olive-shaped knuckles, stylish cabinet hinges, kitchen cabinet hinges, Deltana OK6038B Light Weight Door Hinges,"
